# Inkpath

@retrodesk-1@Vector@ ++Y@(Inkpath++ is a vector graphics editor with box selection, live Bézier point dragging, and panning and zooming around the canvas. Drawings are saved as `.kv` files and export as SVG or PNG!

[Open Inkpath](/inkpath) · [Phone version](/inkpath/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Inkpath|red}
## Drawing tools

* @capsule-2@Selection@ with a drag box for several shapes at once!
* !!-R#Path tools# with real-time Bézier node dragging, and a #/T%knife% for cutting!
* @receipt-2@Gradient tool@ (press ++O;;G++) with fill-line handles. Hold Shift to snap!
* @patch-5@Rulers, guides and snapping@, plus ++T<]align++, ++GL-)layers++ and ++PR/artboards++!

## Blur Behind

!!@L#Blur Behind# turns a shape into frosted glass by blurring everything behind it. The effect survives export!

## Animation

The ++TU6]Animate++ panel adds keyframes:

1. Set a keyframe!
2. Move a shape!
3. Move the playhead and set another keyframe!

You can also use presets like Fade in, Spin or Bounce. Export an SVG that plays by itself in any browser!

## Saving and exporting

Choose **File > Export** for SVG or PNG. Extra SVG features such as caps, dashes, markers, patterns, blend modes, groups and images are supported!
